<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones struck a Komala base in Erbil with no casualties while Iran intensified attacks on Kurdish opposition groups in northern Iraq and a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq's stance on the Iran blockade. Iraqi security forces captured a notorious ISIS gang member in Kirkuk, arrested suspects for usury in Wasit, embezzlement in Mosul and defamation in Najaf, and foiled petroleum-product smuggling in territorial waters. Washington is expanding Shia outreach in Iraq, and NATO held a high-level political dialogue with Iraqi officials. A Jewish heritage museum opened in Baghdad and Iran exempted ships from India and three other nations from Strait of Hormuz transit restrictions. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPaTc3aFNJTHZvanVLaTdZYVlVUDRCOUdpZzdLeGdIcGNJcFl2SlVBa3BRX1dLbkxLM1F3SHdKb0hoZnJUYVJwbUlWZENSQjJsc2diWUcxZzBjMkJrRzhJOWdmYU4wTXZ6eVZSby1mWG5ERk1nbXB6dEt6NGwtOS1KWk9GS1ZGRERmREZObGx6THpjMjh0X0RzVWpTckNVSHJ1cEhMclQ3dG1VTHltUG9JbnZtdXFTZW02bS1udnplOFlDNTVIeldyVFBfWW5DQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Atlantic Council&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxONktwbC1RWG13cjlVSGZta3F0dkxQNlktSnNtb0xrSE5ELUdJc1FoeXczOHdfS1ZFcjNEQ1JhT2xFcmFxcjRkU2czRVBmdGZkcnlRcFVOel9hbzJYS3ZyVm9lZVJCb3JCZkwyRlRYaGtvTUI1SF9jSExBV2Q0OThka3FjZmVVWG0xM0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPakVhX1FnRW1sWUhIS1RtYWJJTDE5Wm5pQ0pLOEFpcUQtU3U4Qm1HeTRxTnNFMEpiOTF6Qll2Mm05SGEwazRhUWI3UzZkNWE0MWJYQ3pSZVVaUlA5LURtUzhFcFNRT2x0UHVGa3NTa0FYbEtYVG5aTGZxU2N0UW4xSkln?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNZUVidmtJczJPZjl2NEdOUjBwVWV1U1g2T0VSWnBLaWtHcjhBZ3pYOXI4S1h5TWhlVDhzN0